  "detail": "This is the last review round. Thank you: dispatch intent, the durable completed result, confirmed termination before deletion and the bounded rate-limit waits are in, all five earlier regressions fail without the round, and the trust boundary is unchanged.\n\nRemaining (reproduced): `cancelGateExecution` (executor.ts ~114) returns silently when the matching executor is unavailable, and the caller then clears the handle (~69). After a restart with a mismatched SHA and no Actions executor, the durable handle disappeared and both branches remained. Clear a handle only after confirmed cleanup. Otherwise keep it, report the unavailable executor with a clear reason, and retry cleanup when the executor is available again."
